{
  "id": "03",
  "title": "專案結構",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05) 100%); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 48px; border-radius: 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading);\">Gravito 遵循一種可預測且整潔的目錄結構。對於熟悉 MVC 的開發者來說會感到非常親切，同時也針對效能與模組化進行了優化。可根據專案需求選擇多種架構模式。</p></div><h2>目錄佈局 (Enterprise MVC)</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito 預設生成的專案採用 <strong>Enterprise MVC</strong> 佈局，最適合大多數的 Web 應用程式：</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\"><code>my-gravito-app/\n├── config/              # 框架與模組設定檔\n│   ├── app.ts           # 核心應用程式設定\n│   ├── database.ts      # 資料庫連接設定\n│   └── auth.ts          # 認證與授權設定\n├── src/\n│   ├── Http/            # HTTP 傳輸層\n│   │   ├── Controllers/ # 控制器 (處理請求邏輯)\n│   │   ├── Middleware/  # 中介層 (過濾請求)\n│   │   └── Kernel.ts    # HTTP 核心 (註冊全域中介層)\n│   ├── Models/          # 資料模型 (Atlas ORM)\n│   ├── Services/        # 商業邏輯層 (Business Logic)\n│   ├── Providers/       # 服務提供者 (Service Providers)\n│   ├── Exceptions/      # 例外處理規則\n│   ├── routes.ts        # 路由定義\n│   └── bootstrap.ts     # 應用程式引導程式\n├── database/            # 資料庫相關資源\n│   ├── migrations/      # 資料表遷移檔\n│   ├── factories/       # 資料工廠 (測試數據生成)\n│   └── seeders/         # 資料種子\n├── public/              # 靜態資源 (圖片、 robots.txt)\n├── tests/               # 測試案例 (Unit & Feature)\n├── gravito.config.ts    # 專案根設定\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json</code></pre></div><h2>核心目錄</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">config/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">包含所有應用程式的設定檔。Gravito 鼓勵將不同功能的設定拆分到獨立的檔案中，以保持整潔。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"></path><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Http/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">處理 Web 請求的入口。<code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">Controllers</code> 負責接收輸入並返回回應，<code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">Middleware</code> 則過濾 HTTP 請求。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Models/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">存放您的 Atlas (ORM) 模型。每個模型通常代表資料庫中的一個資料表。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Services/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">商業邏輯層。Services 封裝複雜操作，可在多個控制器中重複使用。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Providers/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">服務提供者是 Gravito 應用的「點火點」。它們負責將服務綁定到 IoC 容器，並註冊中介層、事件監聽器等。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M10.29 3.86L1 12l9.29 8.14a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l9.29-8.14L11.71 3.86a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0z\"></path><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/bootstrap.ts</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">負責初始化 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">PlanetCore</code> 並載入所需的 Orbits。</p></div></div><h2>請求流程</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">了解請求如何在應用程式中流動：</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); margin: 0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center; color: #FFB800; font-weight: 700;\">請求</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│  Http/Kernel    │ ──▶ 全域中介層</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│    路由器       │ ──▶ 路由匹配</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│   控制器        │ ──▶ 請求處理</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│    服務層       │ ──▶ 商業邏輯</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│   儲存庫        │ ──▶ 資料存取</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center; color: #FFB800; font-weight: 700;\">回應</div></div></div><h2>星系架構</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito 採用「微核心 + Orbits」的設計模式：</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">1</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">PlanetCore</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">極端精簡的微核心，僅負責應用程式生命週期、IoC 容器與 Hook 系統。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">2</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Orbits</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">功能透過可插拔模組擴充。需要資料庫？加入 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">@gravito/atlas</code>。需要驗證？加入 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">@gravito/sentinel</code>。</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">3</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">按需付費</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">應用程式只會運行真正需要的程式碼，確保最佳效能和最小開銷。</p></div></div><h2>應用程式生命週期</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">當您執行 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">gravito dev</code> 或啟動伺服器時：</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">1</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">載入設定</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">系統讀取 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">config/</code> 與 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">gravito.config.ts</code></span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">2</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">註冊提供者</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">執行所有 Service Provider 的 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">register()</code> 方法，將服務綁定到容器</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">3</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">引導提供者</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">執行所有 Service Provider 的 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">boot()</code> 方法，此時所有服務皆已就緒</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">4</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">路由匹配</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">HTTP 請求進入 <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">Http/Kernel</code>，經過中介層後到達控制器</span></div></li></ul></div><h2>架構模式</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito 的強大之處在於其靈活性。雖然 Enterprise MVC 是預設模式，但您可以選擇不同的架構：</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Enterprise MVC</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">預設模式，適合大多數 Web 應用程式。熟悉的結構，清晰的關注點分離。</p><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">適用於：</strong> 傳統 Web 應用、API、後台管理面板</p></div></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Clean Architecture</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">嚴格的依賴規則，將業務邏輯與框架完全解耦。適合長期維護。</p><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">適用於：</strong> 複雜領域、企業應用</p></div></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">領域驅動設計</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">適合超大型或複雜領域邏輯的模組化開發。有界上下文和聚合。</p><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">適用於：</strong> 大型系統、微服務</p></div></div></div>",
